 101:     - The blue components connect the frames into one cycle, with every frame touching exactly two blue components.
 102:     - Each frame interior contains background plus exactly one non-background color mask.
 103: 
 104:     Rule
 105:     - Sort the red frames clockwise by their centers around the cycle.
 106:     - Keep each frame's interior mask shape in place, but recolor it with the interior color from the next clockwise frame.
 107:     - Leave the red frames, blue connectors, background, and interior background holes unchanged.
